---

<aside class="cta-container" aria-label="Analyze your disclosure packet with DisclosurePro AI">
	<div class="cta-content">
		<h2>Protect Your Investment with DisclosurePro AI</h2>
		<p>
			Don't rely on a hasty manual skim to protect your life savings. Upload your 100+ page seller disclosures, home inspection reports, and HOA packets—our AI flags hidden defects, links exact PDF page citations, and estimates repair credits in seconds.
		</p>
		<div class="cta-actions">
			<a
				href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=ai.disclosurepro.app"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="cta-button"
				data-gtag-event="play_store_click"
				data-gtag-label="blog_bottom_cta_google_play"
			>
				Get It on Google Play 🚀
			</a>
			<a
				href="/download"
				class="cta-secondary-button"
				data-gtag-event="cta_download_click"
				data-gtag-label="blog_bottom_cta_ios_web"
			>
				iPhone &amp; Desktop Web Access &rarr;
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</aside>

<style>
	.cta-container {
		margin: 3.5rem auto 2rem;
		border-radius: 16px;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #051326 0%, #0d3870 100%);
		color: white;
		box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.cta-container::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		height: 4px;
		background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1ce3ed, #10b981);
	}

	.cta-content {
		padding: 2.75rem 2.25rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.cta-content h2 {
		color: #f8fafc !important;
		margin-top: 0 !important;
		margin-bottom: 0.85rem !important;
		font-size: 1.7rem !important;
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 1.25;
	}

	.cta-content p {
		color: #cbd5e1 !important;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin-bottom: 1.75rem !important;
		max-width: 620px;
		margin-left: auto;
		margin-right: auto;
	}

	.cta-actions {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 14px;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.cta-button {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1ce3ed 0%, #00a8cc 100%);
		color: #070b19 !important;
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: 1rem;
		padding: 0.9rem 1.75rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
		text-decoration: none !important;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(28, 227, 237, 0.35);
	}

	.cta-button:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(28, 227, 237, 0.5);
	}

	.cta-secondary-button {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 0.9rem 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
		color: #f8fafc !important;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 0.98rem;
		text-decoration: none !important;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
	}

	.cta-secondary-button:hover {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
		border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.cta-content {
			padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
		}
		.cta-content h2 {
			font-size: 1.4rem !important;
		}
		.cta-button,
		.cta-secondary-button {
			width: 100%;
		}
	}
</style>
